  "description": "Version-25 State College curriculum. The cellular-automata simulator provides common-random-number candidate branches. Natural momentum is learned first from WAIT outcomes, candidate-caused physical effects second, and the candidate-score controller only afterward. The actor installs the feasible candidate with the highest score; training uses a decaying epsilon-greedy collection schedule. Hard forecast-safety, operational-benefit, site-capacity, and deployment-budget masks replace reward penalties. Actor and critic use warmup plus cosine learning-rate decay.",
